    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "945a88782c324259",
      "translationZh": "如果你在本地运行智能体，你安装 MCP 服务器的方式很可能和我以前一样：匆匆装上，根本不读它们的代码。我开发 OpenTrustBench，就是为了改掉自己这个习惯。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4286db2d1ce8de6d",
      "translationZh": "8 条映射到 OWASP 的静态规则、权限清单，以及评级从 A 到 F 的信任卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5170ad7ec8eed61c",
      "translationZh": "这个社区的人会关心的一点是：它完全离线。没有 API 调用，没有遥测，不需要账户，也不会回传信息。你的代码绝不会离开本机。如果你想把结果放进仪表板，它支持 SARIF 输出；还提供用于 CI 的 --fail-on 门禁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85bd3e1553bd1e00",
      "translationZh": "如果单个 Docker 镜像更合你的使用习惯，它也提供这种形式：docker run --rm -v (pwd):/workspace eulogik/opentrustbench scan .",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a87f6acd597e47",
      "translationZh": "免费／开源。真心希望这个社区能拿出你们那种偏执的警惕，来审视我的规则集。还缺什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e15a186591502e82",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/BrilliantSecret143 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
